<title>SPAIN: Details of Spanish government revenue forecast.</title>
<headline>Details of Spanish government revenue forecast.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish government gave the following revenue forecasts in its 1997 budget bill (in billions of pesetas unless stated).</p>
<p>					    1996	  1997    pct change</p>
<p>Direct taxes			   7,030	 7,528	7.1</p>
<p>Indirect taxes			 5,765	 6,264	8.3</p>
<p>Levies and other income		376	   428     14.0</p>
<p>Other income			   1,993	 1,869     -6.2</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
